From 8a6caa60ea349c964186a080af656188128d302a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Owen <3221756+christopherowen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 17:16:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 01/10] [Spec] Copy drafts: a verification lookahead apart from
 DSpark's block

speculative_config.copy_drafts (min_match, max_drafts, initial_drafts):
num_verification_tokens is max_drafts, num_speculative_tokens stays DSpark's
block. The scheduler lays out a decoding request's -1 placeholders for the copy
allocation its last output reported (ModelRunnerOutput.copy_draft_alloc), within
VllmConfig.max_decode_rows (every running request at the block, plus one
request's lookahead): rows a slot's waiting request may take this step are not
lent, so an aligned prefill chunk still fits beside the decode rows. A request's
allocation is forgotten at preemption. Acceptance statistics are sized for the
lookahead. Without copy_drafts every size is unchanged.
